Performance Tuning :

	1.Having indexes on the tables going to lookup
	2.in look up and soucrce tr take only required columns
	3.pass sorted input to joiner and aggregator transformation
	4.increase commit intervals 
	5.drop if there are any constraints and reload them when data load is completed.
	6. better to use mapplets and UDFs
	7. tracing level to normal
	
To load huge data :
	add session level partitioing
	increase commit intervals
	increase DTM buffer size
	treat load type as bulk



